{"id":72119,"name":"Mária-út, M02-37 (Püspökszentlászló – Pécs)","category":"hike","country":"HU","generated_at":"2026-08-13T14:18:47+00:00","description_md":"The Maria-ut M02-37 is a waymarked hiking route in Hungary that connects Puspokszentlaszlo to Pecs. This international network trail covers 26.2 km and requires 8.5 hours to complete based on the DIN 33466 hiking time rule.\n\nThe route is signposted as M02/37 and involves 660 m of ascent and 893 m of descent. Due to the distance and elevation gain, the difficulty is classified as hard. Hikers pass within 200 m of the Croat Theatre of Pecs, 300 m of the Ruins of Pasha Memi's bath, and 400 m of the Lutheran Church in Pecs.","distance_m":26189,"ascent_m":660,"descent_m":893,"duration_min":512,"difficulty":"hard","sac_scale":null,"network":"iwn","bbox":[18.214337,46.077579,18.365627,46.190061],"geometry":{"type":"MultiLineString","coordinates":[[[18.365564,46.190061,395.2],[18.365598,46.189997,393],[18.365626,46.18986,388.4],[18.365617,46.189826,387.3],[18.365588,46.189722,384.1],[18.365438,46.189565,378.6],[18.36513,46.189379,375.6],[18.365015,46.189309,374.9],[18.363468,46.188649,374],[18.363291,46.188598,374.2],[18.363177,46.188579,374.3],[18.363043,46.188586,374],[18.362996,46.188591,373.8],[18.362809,46.188612,372.9],[18.362728,46.188639,372.4],[18.362645,46.188685,371.4],[18.362482,46.188798,369.3],[18.362296,46.188901,367.8],[18.36207,46.189,366.6],[18.36195,46.189036,366.4],[18.361808,46.189071,366.1],[18.361738,46.189064,365.9],[18.361626,46.188989,365.7],[18.361488,46.188901,365.4],[18.36137,46.188833,364.8],[18.361226,46.188786,364.2],[18.361017,46.188721,363.6],[18.360931,46.188678,363.3],[18.360885,46.188632,363.1],[18.360862,46.188571,363],[18.360834,46.188495,363],[18.360768,46.18834,362.9],[18.360732,46.188287,362.9],[18.360706,46.18826,362.8],[18.360617,46.188173,362.7],[18.360501,46.188086,362.6],[18.360367,46.188017,362.6],[18.360287,46.187996,362.6],[18.360076,46.187948,361.1],[18.359815,46.18